{"id":"fe06c83d404633c2","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-isomorphism.md","title":"Isomorphism","display":"df-isomorphism — Isomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-isomorphism","aliases":["93-df-isomorphism"],"display":"df-isomorphism — Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[93-df-homomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-isomorphism — Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B\">\\(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B\\)</span> are algebra candidates and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> is a map candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\)</span> is the type-recovering homomorphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\)</span> is the isomorphism predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash \\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land h[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B|\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(h(a)=h(b)\\to a=b)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash \\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land h[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B|\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(h(a)=h(b)\\to a=b)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A bijective homomorphism is an isomorphism; its inverse automatically preserves every finitary basic operation. This form avoids a second, potentially different hidden type witness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}$ is the type-recovering homomorphism predicate of [[93-df-homomorphism]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash \\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land h[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B|\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(h(a)=h(b)\\to a=b)","display":true}],"bytes":933,"backlinks":[{"id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ is the isomorphism predicate of [[93-df-isomorphism]]."},{"id":"2f5dec406c92aa2e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-subdirect-product]] and [[93-df-isomorphism]]."},{"id":"18380974697f948b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ is the algebra-isomorphism predicate of [[93-df-isomorphism]]."},{"id":"e1621c792830f597","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ is the isomorphism predicate of [[93-df-isomorphism]]."},{"id":"ad6be0d5d62b418a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ is the isomorphism predicate of [[93-df-isomorphism]]."},{"id":"db01fac30d0e9c8c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"99723404cc32c530","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ is the isomorphism predicate of [[93-df-isomorphism]]."},{"id":"5db3fa00f537080b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ are the predicates/constructors of [[93-df-powers]] and [[93-df-isomorphism]]."},{"id":"259a663bdd529644","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FreeAlg}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-free-algebra]] and [[93-df-isomorphism]]."},{"id":"ebabc4cd0b0d94d0","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ is the isomorphism predicate of [[93-df-isomorphism]]."},{"id":"fcafc6e9cc20d2e8","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ is the isomorphism predicate of [[93-df-isomorphism]]."},{"id":"4b566884cfea35b9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"co